OL,4,G1500FChoral Evensong
OL,5,     GFrom St James's Church, Sussex
OL,6,     GGardens, London, with the
OL,7,     GRodolfus Choir, with music by
OL,8,     GParry, Jonathan Dove, Poulenc and
OL,9,     GReger.
OL,10,G1600FComposer of the Week: Icons of
OL,11,     FBritish Light Music
OL,12,     GDonald Macleod examines the use
OL,13,     Gof light music in cinema in
OL,14,     GBritain and explores how the
OL,15,     Gtransition from silent movies to
OL,16,     Gthe talkies affected the genre.
